ata-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">木の実で纏う、半歩先のここちよさ</h1></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1665980007984" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1665980007984"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">木の実で纏う、半歩先のここちよさ</h1></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1708587458256" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-gpicon-button" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1708587458256"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-stretch-lg="0"><a class="button btn gf_button gf_gs-button-element gf_gs-button---large" href="{{ shop.url }}{{ routes.root_url | split: '/' | join: '/' }}/collections/2025ss" target="" data-scroll-speed="2000" data-exc=""><span>コレクション一覧へ</span></a></div></div></span></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1665548884399" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1665548884399" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1665548884330" data-id="1665548884330"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1665549000026" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1665549000026" style="display: block;"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">ファッションも地球へのやさしさも諦めない<br>KAPOK KNOTが提案する素材を使った</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">春夏コレクション</h1></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1665742729415" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1665742729415"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">ファッションも地球へのやさしさも諦めない</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">KAPOK KNOTが提案する素材を使った</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">春夏コレクション</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1665548948246" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1665548948246" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span id="docs-internal-guid-b9bbcb02-7fff-f4db-a054-ffa43a3bfc8b"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">KAPOK KNOTは、木の実から生まれた天然素材で</span></span></p><p><span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">衣服を着こなす愉しみも、この先の地球へのやさしさも</span></span></p><p><span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">どちらも妥協しない、</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">今と未来を見据えたものづくりを志しています。&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span></span></p><p><span id="docs-internal-guid-0d2c40e4-7fff-f42d-f6c0-42a637c4bb59"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">わたしたちは、気持ちも、着心地も、 末長く続いていく</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">次の「ここちよさ」をつくりたい。 </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">前向きなファッションの在り方を</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">正直でまっすぐな自然との関わり方を</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">ワクワクとやさしさのどちらも叶う消費と循環を。</span></span><span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span></span></p><p><span id="docs-internal-guid-64859cde-7fff-55e6-9b8a-1a4f5d660535"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal